# =============================================================================
# IMPORTANT: JSONL FILES ARE COMMITTED
# =============================================================================
# The following file types are NOT ignored and will be committed:
# - *.jsonl (training data, metrics, evaluation results)
# - This includes files in data/, math_rlvr/, and all subdirectories
#
# To explicitly allow .jsonl files even in ignored directories, they're
# negated with ! patterns above.
